# 🟡 HashSet

> ⏱ 1 min revision

---

## ✨ Declaration

```java
HashSet<Integer> set = new HashSet<>();
```

---

## ✨ Functions

| Task | Syntax |
|------|--------|
| Add | `set.add(x)` |
| Contains | `set.contains(x)` |
| Remove | `set.remove(x)` |
| Size | `set.size()` |
| Empty | `set.isEmpty()` |
| Clear | `set.clear()` |

---

## ✨ Traversal

```java
for(int x : set){
    System.out.println(x);
}
```

---

## ⭐ Remember

- Stores **unique** values only
- No duplicates
- No indexing (`get()` ❌)

---

